PR #952 live capture: sign in without an intermediate page
=========================================================

BEFORE: https://chat-hive.scubed.co, the deployed demo box running
        main. Loaded signed out; nothing else on that box was touched.
AFTER:  a full local stack -- self-hosted GoTrue v2.189.0, PostgREST,
        storage, Caddy gateway, control-plane, edge-api and Open WebUI
        built from main merged with this branch. Real OAuth 2.1
        authorization-code round trip; no session injected, nothing
        stubbed.

Credential-bearing query parameters are redacted in this log and in
the screenshot URL banners: code, state, nonce, code_challenge,
client_id, authorization_id and any token parameter.

1. BEFORE, on the deployed box today.
   deployed /api/config oauth.auto_redirect = false
   deployed /api/config oauth.providers     = {"oidc":"Hive"}
   "Continue with Hive" buttons rendered: 1
   This is the page the owner objected to: a sign-in page whose only
   action is one button leading to another sign-in page.
  [shot] 01-before-deployed-intermediate-page.png  deployed demo box, signed out: the intermediate page with one button
         url: https://chat-hive.scubed.co/auth

2. AFTER, local stack running this branch.
   local /api/config oauth.auto_redirect = true
   local /api/config providers           = {"oidc":"Hive"}
   local /api/config enable_login_form   = false
   local /api/config onboarding          = undefined

   2a. Setup hop: first ever sign-in on a brand new instance.
       The branch refuses to auto-redirect while onboarding is true,
       so this hop is a click by design. Not the claim under test.
       setup hop landed on: http://localhost:3003
       onboarding now: undefined

   2b. THE CLAIM: chat root, no Open WebUI session, zero clicks.
       clicks performed on this hop:            0
       final origin:                            http://localhost:3003
       password inputs on the landed page:      0
       iframes on the landed page:              0
       "Continue with Hive" buttons:            0
       "Suggested" stock prompt blocks:         0
  [shot] 02-after-signed-in-zero-clicks.png  local branch stack: chat root to signed-in chat, no intermediate page, no clicks
         url: http://localhost:3003/

   Main-frame navigation chain for hop 2b, in order:
     [1] http://localhost:3003/
     [2] http://localhost:3003/auth?redirect=%2F
     [3] http://console.hive.test/oauth/consent?authorization_id=REDACTED
     [4] http://localhost:3003/auth
     [5] http://localhost:3003/

   /auth appears 2 time(s) in the chain above. It is
